{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "e27ddcd14af74a51c69d6ea4b6687999cd1f01f5daad74f53a3d78ad6cdfd700", "ja": "グルグル回る、ジングルベール♪　ベール、ベール……\nはやく来る来る、クリスマース♪", "zh": "转呀转呀，铃儿响叮当♪　叮当、叮当……\n快快到来吧，圣诞节♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c9b64c2d5b1e605cafdd6d4c42f825685c08dee624d5a4ea57bf1bfb7794a3ad", "ja": "あれ、麗花じゃないか。\nどうしたんだ？　こんなところで。", "zh": "哎，这不是丽花吗？\n怎么了？在这种地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "97bd2d2b0d14a78eeee54c7285f572a7e46de8607039ce42370c0adbfc1e4ddf", "ja": "あっ！　あわてんぼうの{$P$}さん\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊！冒冒失失的{$P$}先生\n辛苦您啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1003_p", "source_sha256": "cf42c8910a6d53e496b19560a4cf68e65b0f49a6d73b3080e48d8b941f6ca5d9", "ja": "え、えっと……。\nごめん。ちょっと説明がほしいな、麗花。", "zh": "呃，那个……  \n抱歉，我想听你稍微解释一下，丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "b47a5db12869779aa76b8ccf6dac656429d7682b8a0decbd0a1fb62ad2f6cfa0", "ja": "はい。私、クリスマス会の飾りを探してたんです。\n倉庫にあるって、美咲さんが教えてくれました♪", "zh": "是的。我正在找圣诞派对的装饰品。\n美咲告诉我，说仓库里有♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1005_p", "source_sha256": "19db37b88e9f19ec28654113ba5dc01171f861855e331ec51877e58b7a0fff04", "ja": "クリスマス会？　この前、終わったはずだけど。\nほら。麗花がスノーマンの格好をして……。", "zh": "圣诞派对？前阵子不是已经结束了吗？\n你看，丽花还打扮成雪人的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "7df26d3965b2bf60b07fc1e96ec1578b4198f2e9551b2182fde6415915819950", "ja": "はい、すっごく楽しかったです！\nだから次のクリスマス会の準備をしようと思って。", "zh": "是的，特别开心！\n所以我想准备下一次圣诞聚会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8645477fdf010458ccdb3e0d7a0c76594633b23e3c0bfcff9eee0d4777290587", "ja": "な、なるほど？　それで片付けたばかりの飾りを\n探してたってことか。たしかにあわてんぼうだな……。", "zh": "原、原来如此？所以你是在找刚收拾好的装饰啊。确实够冒失的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "4a856f36d2887bd2613463169cf8128ab2efcdfadbe1697da0cf0edf75e2e1f5", "ja": "えへへ♪　見えるところに置いておけば、\nいつでもクリスマス会ができますよね！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 只要放在看得见的地方，随时都能举办圣诞聚会了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "331c986e21f559679e4a491b15542064ab484c9a0a472bb763b7a14e6cb66034", "ja": "というわけで、{$P$}さんも一緒に\nあわてんぼうのサンタクロースさん、しませんか？", "zh": "所以，{$P$}先生也要不要一起来当个慌慌张张的圣诞老人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7a379e086e13ebaf5aea7940b86c9f9511a94914dcce5ffd5673804b13d6a45c", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。春、夏、秋……\n一年中クリスマス気分を味わえるってことか。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。春天、夏天、秋天……\n也就是说，一年四季都能享受圣诞节的气氛啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "b20cb32a6924f314a45370be5c59a4208d6a5a1480e2ddfa4b52beea063476e0", "ja": "春のクリスマスだから春スマス。夏なら夏スマス……\n秋なら秋スマス……冬なら、冬スマスですね！", "zh": "春天的圣诞就叫春诞，夏天的话就叫夏诞……\n秋天的话就叫秋诞……冬天的话，就叫冬诞呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1a2b33566b5c6b1adacecb04d1c298219f13ff36b97cfc8e8f2997150ae75a23", "ja": "ん？　冬はふつうにクリスマスでいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯？冬天按平常那样叫圣诞节不就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "15f7fd82c1afef688c21d70bb97dca900126b33a571b8f1dfde8d1e76ed3bb90", "ja": "あ、そうですね♪　他には……年末スマスに\nお正月スマス、お盆スマスなんかもできそうです！", "zh": "啊，说得也是♪ 另外……还可以做年末圣诞、新年圣诞、盂兰盆节圣诞之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1014_p", "source_sha256": "99057e9d18761a1073749975b56dbb9652c9657e93963c0926e193d5957072f6", "ja": "それは、クリスマス以外の別の物になってるような\n……。とにかく、飾りは12月までしまっておこう。", "zh": "那好像已经变成圣诞节以外的别的东西了……总之，装饰品就收起来放到12月吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "4e59997d8d784e19831ffa6f450edc221b96b7432745294d051e79739a57366b", "ja": "は～い、わかりました！　次のクリスマスに\n倉庫から出すのを楽しみにしてますねっ♪", "zh": "好～的，明白啦！我很期待下次圣诞节\n从仓库里把它拿出来呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0613_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "9b58b1712300ea65c96c43b25a07e203b8aac038a26f45039a36b00b19320d17", "ja": "グルグルめぐる、春夏秋冬～♪\nはやく来い来い、クリスマース♪　えへへ。", "zh": "春夏秋冬循环往复～♪\n圣诞节快点来吧，快点来吧～♪嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
